       The  ccoommppoossiittee--iimm66..qq1166  program  is  a  member  of   the   ImageMagick-
       ims6.q16(1) suite of tools.  Use it to overlap one image over another.

       For more information about the composite command, point your browser to
       file:///usr/share/doc/imagemagick-6-common/html/www/composite.html  (on
       debian   system   you   may   install  the  imagemagick-6  package)  or
       http://imagemagick.org/script/composite.php.

